WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.067
Everything on Measure.

00:00:02.767 --> 00:00:08.300
Open the estimate. Measuring starts from an estimate. The tour opens this one.

00:00:08.800 --> 00:00:15.667
Measure. Opens the Measure screen for this estimate (it saves your changes first). The tour opens it.

00:00:16.167 --> 00:00:21.267
Which estimate. The estimate number and the customer you are measuring for.

00:00:21.767 --> 00:00:30.833
The property address. The satellite photo opens on this address. With no address on the customer, search for the house on the map instead.

00:00:31.300 --> 00:00:40.467
Back to the estimate. Goes back to the estimate. What you drew is kept only if you save it first with Save and go to the estimate, under the map.

00:00:40.967 --> 00:00:45.533
Customer. Opens the customer: phones, notes, gate codes.

00:00:46.033 --> 00:00:55.733
How to draw. Under this note is the satellite photo. Pick what you are measuring, then tap the corners. Tap the first corner again to close the shape.

00:00:56.233 --> 00:01:07.633
What you can measure. Patio / pavers, Driveway, Walkway, Lawn and Beds / mulch as areas in square feet; Wall / edging as a line in feet. Search moves the map.

00:01:08.133 --> 00:01:16.067
Fix and cut out. Drag a corner to adjust a shape. Use Cut-out to take a pool, the house or a bed out of an area.

00:01:16.567 --> 00:01:26.233
Save it onto the estimate. Under the map, What you measured adds it up by kind as you draw. Save and go to the estimate keeps it and takes you back.

00:01:26.733 --> 00:01:37.067
Then, on the estimate. A Measured card lists each area: Add makes it a section, or "Use a measurement" in a section fills its quantity. Open comes back here.

00:01:37.567 --> 00:01:43.167
That's it. You can play this tour in the app any time: press Help, and ask in your own words.
